+ * Recreation of the reference deck with pptxgenjs.
+ *
+ * The original's photographs and device mockups become `photo()` / `device()`
+ * placeholders labelled "[image]" — no raster data is embedded. Its empty
+ * picture placeholders carry no artwork and are therefore not drawn.
+ */
